      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tricky race to kick off the card with a few of these facing the starter for the first time. Of the raced brigade MAGIC INVADER (2) resumes here but showed enough when last in work to warrant serious consideration in a race like this. Revved up for this with a recent trial win and gets some weight relief with the 1.5kg claim. Rates the testing material. SNITZSTREAM (9) will strip fitter second-up from the break and is drawn to get all the favours from the inside marble. Looms as the main danger. MACHTIG HAVANAGILA (4) just missed the frame in town when resuming before maybe suffering from the dreaded second-up syndrome last time out. Watch for a spike in form. The well-related FAWUNDERPAR (3) (half to G2 winner Blueberry Hill) has been thereabouts in both starts to date and may earn some minor money again. SAVASTEEL (5) next in line.",
